OL,3,ADense fog threatens Monday morning
OL,4,Arush-hour disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,7,Fwarning for dense fog across much of
OL,8,FEngland and eastern Wales running from
OL,9,F18:00 on Sunday until 11:00 on Monday.
OL,10,FA separate yellow fog warning has also
OL,11,Fbeen issued for Northern Ireland and
OL,12,Fruns from 22:00 on Sunday until 10:00
OL,13,Fon Monday. See warning details here.
OL,15,FThe larger fog warning for England and
OL,16,FWales covers an area of the southern UK
OL,17,Fstretching from Canterbury to Cardiff,
OL,18,FHull to St Asaph and Southampton to
OL,19,FYork, and includes London, Birmingham
OL,20,Fand parts of Greater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
